OL,3,GNEWSADancer's family were told to say
OL,4,Agoodbye after stroke - now he hopes to
OL,5,Aperform again
OL,6,
OL,7,FIntensive speech and physiotherapy
OL,8,Fmeans he can now form sentences and
OL,9,Fwalk short distances with a mobility
OL,10,Faid.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
